      "id": "post-details-5",
      "name": "Sticky Sidebar Layout",
      "description": "Main article content alongside a sticky sidebar with author info.",
      "html": "\n                        <style>\n                          .pd5-wrap{padding:80px 20px;background:#f9fafb;font-family:sans-serif;}\n                          .pd5-container{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;gap:50px;}\n                          .pd5-main{flex:1;}\n                          .pd5-title{color:#111;font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,48px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 20px 0;}\n                          .pd5-img{width:100%;height:400px;background:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542744173-8e7e53415bb0?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop') center/cover;border-radius:12px;margin:30px 0;}\n                          .pd5-main p{font-size:18px;color:#4b5563;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 25px 0;}\n                          .pd5-sidebar{width:300px;flex-shrink:0;}\n                          .pd5-sticky{position:sticky;top:40px;background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);}\n                          @media(max-width:900px){.pd5-container{flex-direction:column;} .pd5-sidebar{width:100%;} .pd5-sticky{position:static;}}\n                        </style>\n                        <section class=\"pd5-wrap\">\n                            <div class=\"pd5-container\">\n                                <article class=\"pd5-main\">\n                                    <span style=\"color:#10b981;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;\">Business</span>\n                                    <h1 class=\"pd5-title\">Scaling Your Startup in a Bear Market</h1>\n                                    <div class=\"pd5-img\"></div>\n                                    <p>Economic downturns are notoriously difficult times to raise capital, but they are often the best times to build. Without the distraction of hyper-growth at all costs, founders are forced to focus on profitability, unit economics, and building a product that truly solves a painful problem.</p>\n                                    <p>The companies that emerge victorious from a bear market are those that master capital efficiency. It requires making tough decisions early and establishing a culture of resourcefulness. In this post, we explore strategies from founders who successfully navigated the last recession.</p>\n                                </article>\n                                <aside class=\"pd5-sidebar\">\n                                    <div class=\"pd5-sticky\">\n                                        <div style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;\">\n                                            <div style=\"width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;background:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560250097-0b93528c311a?q=80&w=200&auto=format&fit=crop') center/cover;margin:0 auto 15px auto;\"></div>\n                                            <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 5px 0;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#111;\">Mark Anderson</h3>\n                                            <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#6b7280;\">Venture Capitalist & Author</p>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div style=\"border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:20px;\">\n                                            <h4 style=\"font-size:14px;color:#111;margin:0 0 15px 0;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;\">Share this article</h4>\n                                            <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;\">\n                                                <button style=\"flex:1;padding:10px;background:#f3f4f6;border:none;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;color:#374151;\">Twitter</button>\n                                                <button style=\"flex:1;padding:10px;background:#f3f4f6;border:none;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;color:#374151;\">LinkedIn</button>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </aside>\n                            </div>\n                        </section>\n                    "
    }
